# The serving configuration the published vision numbers were produced against.
#
# Ollama defaults to a 4096 token context, which is not a model limit but a
# server default. A statement page costs about 2700 prompt tokens, and the
# longest statements need roughly 2500 more to answer, so generation stopped
# mid object and the JSON never parsed. Every failed response sat at exactly
# 4096 total tokens and nothing below it ever failed, which is what identified
# the window rather than the model as the cause. A wider window costs latency,
# so the tradeoff is deliberate: a scanned statement takes two to six minutes
# here instead of one.
FROM qwen2.5vl:7b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
